4:["$","p",null,{"children":"The America.Fun Platform and America.Fun Services generally involve interacting with user-generated Digital Assets in various ways. Neither the America.Fun Entities nor any affiliates are responsible for user-generated Digital Assets that you may, in your sole discretion, engage with on the America.Fun Platform or via the America.Fun Services. Please ensure that you fully understand the risks involved with user-generated Digital Assets before using the America.Fun Platform and America.Fun Services."}]
5:["$","p",null,{"children":"The value of User-Generated Digital Assets, especially memecoins that are commonly found on the America.Fun Platform and as part of the America.Fun Services, can fluctuate significantly and there is a material risk of economic loss when buying, selling, holding or investing in any Digital Asset. You should therefore consider whether participating on the America.Fun Platform in general or America.Fun Services specifically is suitable for you taking into account your personal circumstances, financial, or otherwise."}]
6:["$","p",null,{"children":"You acknowledge that we are not your broker, intermediary, agent or advisor and we have no fiduciary relationship or obligation to you in connection with any activities you undertake when using the America.Fun Platform or America.Fun Services. We do not and are not providing any investment or consulting advice and no communication or information that we provide to you is intended to be, or should be construed as, advice of any kind. We do not recommend that any user-generated Digital Asset be bought, earned, sold or held by you under any circumstances."}]
7:["$","p",null,{"children":"You are responsible for determining whether any user-generated Digital Asset is appropriate for you to acquire, transact in, or otherwise use on the America.Fun Platform or with America.Fun Services based on your personal investment objectives, financial circumstances and risk tolerance and you are responsible for any associated loss or liability. Before making the decision to buy, sell or hold any user-generated Digital Asset, you should conduct your own due diligence and about the creator of the Digital Asset and, where appropriate, consult your financial advisor. We are not responsible for the decisions you make to buy, earn, sell or hold Digital Assets based on the information or services provided by us or by users themselves through the America.Fun Platform or America.Fun Services, including any losses you may incur based on your decisions."}]
