1b:["$","h2",null,{"children":"3. America.Fun Platform"}]
1c:["$","p",null,{"children":"3.1. Usage of the America.Fun Platform and America.Fun Services is provided at our absolute discretion. We reserve the right to refuse any usage of, or restrict your access to, the America.Fun Platform and America.Fun Services for any reason, or without reason at any time."}]
1d:["$","p",null,{"children":"3.2. You must not take any action or otherwise post, upload or publish to the America.Fun Platform any abusive, defamatory, dishonest, or obscene message or any messages intended to manipulate a market or to spread false or misleading information or messages that are otherwise in contravention of Applicable Laws. Violating this provision may result in termination of or restrictions on the availability of the America.Fun Platform and America.Fun Services to you."}]
1e:["$","p",null,{"children":"3.3. You must not take any action or otherwise post, upload or publish to any platform or media any abusive, defamatory, dishonest, or obscene message or any messages intended to manipulate a market or to spread false or misleading information or messages that are otherwise in contravention of Applicable Laws in respect of any user-generated Digital Assets created using the America.Fun Services. Violating this provision may result in termination of or restrictions on the availability of the America.Fun Services to you."}]
1f:["$","h2",null,{"children":"4. Fees and Calculations"}]
20:["$","p",null,{"children":"4.1. America.Fun Entities and affiliates do not charge any fees related to accessing the America.Fun Platform (including the america.Fun web app or other interfaces). We reserve the right to introduce or modify access-related fees in the future in accordance with these Terms."}]
21:["$","p",null,{"children":"4.2. Certain America.Fun Services may require the payment of fees, including but not limited to fees associated with token creation, transactions, staking, rewards mechanisms, or other on-chain interactions, as disclosed on the America.Fun Platform at the time you submit an Instruction. You are responsible for reviewing and accepting all applicable fees before initiating any Instruction. Fees and mechanics may vary by feature and may be updated from time to time as displayed on the Platform."}]
22:["$","p",null,{"children":"4.3. By submitting an Instruction using your Wallet, you authorise the applicable smart contract(s) and/or transaction(s) that you cryptographically sign to transfer any applicable fees, charges, or other amounts associated with that Instruction from your Wallet. For the avoidance of doubt, the America.Fun Entities and affiliates do not take custody of your Digital Assets and do not have the ability to access, debit, or control your Wallet outside of Instructions you explicitly approve."}]
23:["$","p",null,{"children":"4.4. You acknowledge and agree that your use of the America.Fun Platform and America.Fun Services may involve fees charged by third parties, including blockchain network fees (such as gas fees), validators, liquidity providers, Wallet providers, or other protocols. The America.Fun Entities and affiliates do not control and are not responsible for such third-party fees, and you are solely responsible for paying them."}]
24:["$","p",null,{"children":"4.5. We may modify applicable fees from time to time by updating these Terms and/or the fee disclosures on the America.Fun Platform in accordance with Section 14 (Amending the Terms). Any updated fees apply from the time they are displayed on the America.Fun Platform or otherwise communicated to you, unless Applicable Law requires otherwise. Your continued use of the America.Fun Platform or relevant America.Fun Services constitutes acceptance of the updated fees."}]
25:["$","h2",null,{"children":"5. Records"}]
