28:["$","p",null,{"children":"6.1. To access the America.Fun Platform and America.Fun Services, you must have the necessary equipment (such as a computer or smartphone) and access to the internet. You can access the America.Fun Platform and America.Fun Services through the use of bots or otherwise as we may permit from time to time, as long as such access otherwise complies with all requirements and rules established in these Terms."}]
29:["$","p",null,{"children":"6.2. The use of the America.Fun Platform and other access methods may be subject to such additional terms as we require from time to time and which we will communicate to you."}]
2a:["$","h2",null,{"children":"7. Transaction Reversals"}]
2b:["$","p",null,{"children":"7.1. You acknowledge and agree that where you execute any Transaction with Improper Intent and/or in the case of Manifest Error, America.Fun is authorised by you (without any payment or penalty or liability due by America.Fun and provided that such action is in compliance with Applicable Law) to cancel/void such Transaction (to the extent possible), take such actions as America.Fun may reasonably deem fit and treat such Transaction as if it had never been entered into."}]
2c:["$","p",null,{"children":"7.2. We may be required under these Terms or Applicable Law to share information about your activities on America.Fun with third parties and within America.Fun. You acknowledge and agree that we are entitled to disclose such information."}]
2d:["$","h2",null,{"children":"8. Submission of Instructions"}]
2e:["$","p",null,{"children":"8.1. Instructions are transactions or commands executed on the Solana blockchain using the America.Fun Platform and America.Fun Services. You must ensure that any Instruction submitted is complete and accurate. We are not required to verify the accuracy, authenticity or validity of any Instruction and will not monitor or reject Instructions on the basis that they are, or appear to be, duplicates. In our sole, absolute discretion, we may refuse to act upon or defer acting upon any Instruction, or seek further information with respect to the Instruction."}]
2f:["$","p",null,{"children":"8.2. You acknowledge and agree that Instructions are irrevocable once submitted for broadcast to the Solana network. If the America.Fun Platform uses server infrastructure or third-party providers to facilitate the submission or broadcasting of Instructions, an Instruction will be considered submitted when it is received by such infrastructure for broadcasting. Settlement and finality occur on-chain, and we do not control whether the Solana network confirms a transaction."}]
30:["$","p",null,{"children":"8.3. By submitting an Instruction, you authorise the applicable smart contract(s) and/or transaction(s) that you cryptographically sign using your Wallet to execute the relevant Transaction on the Solana blockchain in accordance with your Instruction. If you have insufficient Digital Assets in your Wallet to effect the Transaction (including applicable fees), we may not be able to facilitate the Instruction through the Platform. It is your responsibility to maintain sufficient Digital Assets in your Wallet."}]
31:["$","p",null,{"children":"8.4. You are aware that Instructions and information transmitted on the America.Fun Platform or by email are generally transmitted via the internet and may be routed via public, transnational installations which are not specifically protected. We cannot guarantee that the Instructions and information transmitted will be completely protected against unauthorised access, and you accept the associated risks. Our privacy practices and your rights are disclosed in our Privacy Notice."}]
32:["$","h2",null,{"children":"9. Transactions"}]
33:["$","p",null,{"children":"9.1. We do not represent or warrant that any actions by you on the America.Fun Platform or use of the America.Fun Services will be completed successfully or within a specific time period. By accessing and using the America.Fun Platform and America.Fun Services, you represent that you understand that smart contract transactions, like the ones conducted through the America.Fun Platform and America.Fun Services, automatically execute and settle, and that blockchain-based systems are variable and transaction speeds may increase dramatically at any time."}]
34:["$","p",null,{"children":"9.2. You expressly agree that the America.Fun Entities and affiliates are permitted, but not required, to keep a record of all Transaction information related to use of the America.Fun Platform and America.Fun Services. You further agree that we may keep this information, if we collect it, for as long as it is required to fulfill its intended purpose or any other period of time as required by Applicable Law."}]
35:["$","h2",null,{"children":"10. Material Interests and Conflicts"}]
36:["$","p",null,{"children":"10.1. You understand and agree that neither your relationship with us nor any services we provide to you, nor any other matter, will give rise to any duties on our part or on the part of any America.Fun Entity or affiliate, whether legal, equitable, fiduciary in nature, save as are expressly set out in these Terms. In particular, America.Fun Entities and affiliates may from time to time act in more than one capacity, and in those capacities we may receive fees or commissions from more than one user (including you). You agree that we may act in such capacities and provide any other services or carry out any business with or for you, any other America.Fun Entity or affiliate or any other user."}]
37:["$","p",null,{"children":"10.2. You understand and agree that, except as required under our Privacy Notice, the America.Fun Entities and affiliates will not be required to:"}]
