42:["$","p",null,{"children":"12.2. At all times, you, and anyone you permit to access the America.Fun Platform and America.Fun Services using your Wallet (\"Permitted Users\"), shall maintain adequate security and control of all of the information used to access the America.Fun Platform and America.Fun Services. You are responsible for taking the necessary security measures to protect such details, including by:"}]
