9a:["$","p",null,{"children":"23.1. Staking Feature. America.Fun may allow you to stake certain Digital Assets by submitting Instructions that interact with one or more smart contracts (the \"Staking Contracts\"). By staking, you direct the Staking Contracts to lock, delegate, transfer, or otherwise control your Digital Assets according to the rules encoded in the applicable Staking Contracts and as displayed on America.Fun at the time you submit your Instruction."}]
9b:["$","p",null,{"children":"23.2. User-Controlled; No Custody. Staking is initiated solely by you through your Wallet. You acknowledge and agree that (a) we do not take custody of your Digital Assets, (b) we do not control your Wallet or private keys, and (c) Staking Contracts are deployed and executed on-chain and may operate independently of the America.Fun interface."}]
9c:["$","p",null,{"children":"23.3. Rewards Are Not Guaranteed. Any rewards, yield, fees, or other distributions (\"Rewards\") that may be displayed or referenced on the America.Fun Platform are estimates only and may change at any time. Rewards are not guaranteed and may be lower than expected or zero, and are subject to change at any time depending on the Platform (including, without limitation, changes to parameters, eligibility, distribution mechanics, claim windows, or available Rewards pools). You acknowledge and agree that Rewards (if any) may also be affected by factors outside our control, including market conditions, protocol parameters, third-party actions, network congestion, price volatility, and smart contract behavior."}]
9d:["$","p",null,{"children":"23.4. Lockups; Early Unlock Penalties. Certain staking options may include lockup periods, cooldowns, claim windows, forfeiture rules, early unlock penalties, or other restrictions. You are solely responsible for reviewing and understanding the applicable rules and consequences before staking or unstaking. Once you submit an Instruction, it is irreversible and may result in penalties, forfeiture of principal and/or Rewards, or other outcomes as determined by the Staking Contracts."}]
9e:["$","p",null,{"children":"23.5. Staking Risks. You understand and agree that staking Digital Assets involves substantial risk, including the risk of partial or total loss of your staked Digital Assets and/or Rewards. Risks include, without limitation: smart contract vulnerabilities or exploits; protocol or oracle failures; network events; validator or third-party failures; slashing (if applicable); forks; governance changes; degraded liquidity; price volatility; and any errors or failures of the America.Fun Platform, the Solana network, or other third-party services."}]
9f:["$","p",null,{"children":"23.6. No Advice. We do not provide investment, tax, legal, or accounting advice regarding staking. You are solely responsible for determining whether staking is appropriate for you and for obtaining any independent advice you deem necessary."}]
a0:["$","p",null,{"children":"23.7. No Liability for Staking Losses. To the maximum extent permitted by Applicable Law, the America.Fun Entities and affiliates will not be liable for any losses, damages, or liabilities arising out of or relating to Staking, including any loss of principal, loss of Rewards, forfeitures, penalties, missed claim windows, failed or delayed transactions, smart contract behavior, or market price changes, except where such losses arise solely and directly from our wilful misconduct or actual fraud."}]
