ed:["$","p",null,{"children":"32.1. To use the America.Fun Platform and America.Fun Services, you must connect or access a digital wallet that is compatible with the Platform (a \"Wallet\"). Wallets may be provided by third-party wallet providers or generated through third-party infrastructure integrated into the Platform. You acknowledge and agree that the America.Fun Entities and affiliates do not provide Wallet services, do not control any Wallet, and do not have access to your private keys, seed phrases, credentials, or signing authority."}]
ee:["$","p",null,{"children":"32.2. You are solely responsible for maintaining the security, confidentiality, and control of your Wallet and any associated credentials, private keys, or recovery information. The America.Fun Entities and affiliates are not responsible for any loss, theft, or compromise of your Digital Assets arising from Wallet access, key management, user error, device compromise, phishing, malware, or third-party Wallet provider actions."}]
ef:["$","p",null,{"children":"32.3. Where Wallet Functionality is provided or facilitated by third-party providers, you acknowledge that such providers operate independently of America.Fun and may be subject to separate terms, conditions, and privacy policies. America.Fun does not endorse, control, or assume responsibility for the operation, availability, or security of any third-party Wallet."}]
